            "sid": "HEB 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa hivyo gara huchigosikira, nahuzidini kugalunga, husedze hukagaricha na kulunga mambo ganjina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hinyo ujumbe uriorehwa ni malaika kpwa akare ehu wakala ni uogophewe, na osi ariouricha na kurema kuulunga atiywa adabu kulengana na makosa gao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dze swino hundawezadze kuepuka kutiywa adabu husiphojali wokofu urio mkpwulu namuna hino? Bwana Jesu mwenye ndiye ariyeandza kutangaza wokofu hinyo, na hara ariomsikira achihuhakikishira kala ni kpweli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mlungu piya walavya ushaidi wa wokofu hinyo kpwa kuhenda dalili, maajabu na vilinje, na kulavya vipawa vya Roho Mtakatifu kama arivyomendza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.2.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
